        // Due to the adversarial receiver rev reverting on receive, in the reference implementation when a player transfer reverts,
        // the contract's pot should reflect: previous pot + TICKET_AMOUNT - FEE_AMOUNT (the fee may have been taken or the entire payout failed depending on ordering),
        // specifically the invariant we check is that after the call (regardless of ok), the pot is NOT zero when the player reverted —
